hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"199","On the authority of Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ajlan, on the authority of Saeed, he is the son of Abi Saeed Al-Maqbari, on the authority of Ubaid bin Jurayj, He said: It was said to Ibn Umar: We saw you doing something that we had not seen anyone else do. He said: “What is it?” They said: We saw you wearing these Sabbath sandals. He said: “I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, wearing them and performing ablution in them. And he wipes over it.” Abu Bakr said: And the hadith of Ibn Abbas and Aws bin Aws from this chapter."
